  "title": "FerriteSolidMechanics.jl",
  "description": "A solid mechanics assembly framework and material model library for Ferrite.jl. A generic material assembler handles DOFs, sparse assembly, threading, MPI reduction and trial/commit state updating, so a constitutive model is written only at the quadrature point (UMAT-like) level. The bundled models range from linear elasticity to finite-strain hyperelastic and viscoelastic-viscoplastic laws.",
